1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,925
Jalen Brunson Captures NBA Finals MVP and ESPY Glory.

2
00:00:04,875 --> 00:00:17,587
Jalen Brunson completed a historic 2025-26 season by leading the New York Knicks to an NBA championship and earning Finals MVP honors before adding the ESPY for Best Athlete to his collection.

3
00:00:17,587 --> 00:00:27,650
The Villanova product averaged 31.4 points and 8.7 assists throughout the playoffs, cementing his status as the Knicks' franchise cornerstone.

4
00:00:27,650 --> 00:00:35,837
Brunson's rise from second-round draft pick to NBA Finals MVP resonated across the league as a testament to relentless improvement.

5
00:00:35,837 --> 00:00:45,350
His ESPY win for Best Athlete placed him alongside legends who have claimed the award, signaling his arrival as one of professional sports' premier performers.

6
00:00:45,350 --> 00:00:54,612
The Knicks' championship parade through Manhattan drew an estimated 2 million fans, ending a championship drought that had stretched back to 1973.

7
00:00:54,612 --> 00:01:03,675
Brunson's postseason performance, which included three 45-point games, redefined what is possible for a guard listed at just 6-foot-2.

8
00:01:03,675 --> 00:01:09,787
His leadership and clutch shot-making have positioned the Knicks as a perennial contender for years to come.

